            "text": "<h2>Our 100% Satisfaction Guarantee</h2><p>We believe in the transformative power of Igniton products—so much so that we offer a 100% satisfaction guarantee. If for any reason you're not fully satisfied, simply return the unused portion of your product within 30 days of receipt, and we'll issue a full refund of the purchase price.</p>"
          }
        },
