    "5a7cb87a-96ea-4e6b-be7d-e8cbd28c4fc2": {
      "type": "testimonials",
      "blocks": {
        "template--20293138153793__5a7cb87a-96ea-4e6b-be7d-e8cbd28c4fc2-testimonial-2": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>“Around the two-month mark, I started to notice the shift. My energy came back in waves. I was waking up ready to move—not dreading the first steps.  The real kicker? My doctor called after my routine blood work and said, ‘What on earth have you been doing?’ My inflammation markers had dropped over 80%. He was floored. So was I.”</p><p><em>— Verified customer</em></p>",
            "author": "At 64, I Thought My Best Years Were Behind Me… Then I Found IgniLongevity.",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        },
        "template--20293138153793__5a7cb87a-96ea-4e6b-be7d-e8cbd28c4fc2-testimonial-3": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>I started taking <em>Igni</em>Longevity about a month ago. I do feel better and my blood pressure was noticeably lower, even during stressful situations which was surprising.”</p><p><em>— Lisa</em></p>",
            "author": "“I will definitely keep using IgniLongevity.",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_VyGzhm": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>in my energy levels and stamina just over a week into taking <em>Igni</em>Longevity. I went on a retreat in the mountains and everyone I was with was struggling to keep up on the hikes, needed afternoon naps, or felt exhausted by the end of the day - which usually would have been my experience, but I felt vibrant and energetic and slept great even after long physically taxing days.”</p><p><em>— Stef W.</em></p>",
            "author": "“I noticed a significant difference",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_Mwbx4M": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>and indeed have seen better brain performance.”</p><p><em>— Milton</em></p>",
            "author": "“As of now, I feel more energetic",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        }
      },
