    "columns_1_BU87in": {
      "type": "columns-1",
      "blocks": {
        "dropdown_jCaEyG": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "Why are Igniton supplements more expensive than some other brands?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Igniton products are priced higher because they are <strong>built on decades of advanced quantum physics research, use the most premium ingredients, contain no excipients or fillers, and are manufactured through an incredibly complex and precise scientific process</strong>.</p><p>Unlike ordinary supplements, Igniton formulas are created using cold plasma and laser technologies to embed a neutral, quasi-particle called the <strong>igniton</strong>. This process involves equipment and techniques normally reserved for high-level physics labs, including:</p><ul><li>High-vacuum plasma chambers</li><li>Laser photonics</li><li>Igniton detectors</li></ul><p>This means we’re not just blending powders—we’re <strong>engineering at the quantum level</strong> to create supplements that work with the body’s energy systems and cellular biology.</p><p>In addition, we use:</p><ul><li><strong>No excipients or fillers</strong>—every capsule contains only active, clean, effective ingredients</li><li><strong>High-dose, clinical-grade nutrients</strong> that exceed typical industry standards</li><li><strong>Rigorous quality control</strong> with advanced computer-monitored systems</li></ul><p>All of this makes manufacturing more difficult and more costly—but it ensures that each Igniton product delivers <strong>real, measurable benefits</strong>.</p><p><strong>In short:</strong> You’re not paying for hype—you’re investing in <strong>cutting-edge science</strong>, <strong>pure ingredients</strong>, and a commitment to <strong>human performance and longevity</strong> unlike anything else on the market.</p>",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#101123",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "dropdown_if9teH": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "How will I know if Igniton products are working?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p><strong>You’ll know Igniton products are working by the way you feel—and the results you notice in your daily life.</strong></p><p>Most people start to experience cognitive benefits within the first <strong>1 to 3 weeks</strong>, and longevity benefits after 30-60 days, depending on their body and lifestyle. Here are some common signs that the supplements are doing their job:</p><ul><li><strong>Clearer thinking and better focus<br/></strong>You may notice it's easier to concentrate, solve problems, or remember things.</li><li><strong>More balanced energy throughout the day<br/></strong>Instead of feeling drained or jittery, many users report a smoother, more stable energy flow.</li><li><strong>Less body tension and discomfort<br/></strong>Some people feel reduced joint stiffness or quicker recovery from workouts due to inflammation support. </li><li><strong>Improved mood and mental calm<br/></strong><em>Igni</em>ton’s impact on brain and cellular health can also support emotional resilience and stress marker reduction.</li></ul><p>We recommend tests such as cognitive testing, EEG brain scans and blood tests to verify the impact of Igniton products. </p>",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#101123",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "dropdown_TmUbFb": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "How do ignitons get into the supplements?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>We use a proprietary technology featuring cold plasma and laser pulses to “charge” key nutrients with ignitons. Unlike ordinary supplements, Igniton formulas are created to embed ignitons on the protons of the supplement ingredients’ Hydrogen atoms. This process involves equipment and techniques normally reserved for high-level physics labs, including:</p><ul><li>High-vacuum plasma chambers</li><li>Laser photonics</li><li>Igniton detectors </li></ul><p>This means we’re not just blending powders—we’re <strong>engineering at the quantum level</strong> to create supplements that work with the body’s energy systems and cellular biology.</p>",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#101123",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "dropdown_AytYyY": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Are ignitons safe?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Yes. Ignitons are naturally occurring quasi-particles originating from the sun and found in the energy fields all around us. In fact, your body is constantly bombarded by billions of ignitons that pass right through you every second. Our process stabilizes them and embeds them to nutrients that can then be absorbed by your body.</p>",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#101123",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "dropdown_my3iWN": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "What results can I expect from Igniton products?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Users report: sharper thinking, better memory, attention, and focus, lower stress and inflammation markers, lower blood pressure, and lower brain age. Clinical trials confirm these results, with significant improvements in cognition, memory, inflammation markers, blood pressure, and cellular energy—without using stimulants or synthetic ingredients.</p>",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#101123",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "dropdown_EeWnLJ": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Can I take Igniton products with other supplements or medications?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Ignitons are safe to take alongside other high-quality supplements. However, if you are on medication, supplements, or have a medical condition, please consult your healthcare provider before starting a new routine.<br/><br/>The information provided on this website and the products sold are not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease. The statements regarding dietary supplements have not been evaluated by the Food and Drug Administration (FDA).</p><p>Always consult with a qualified healthcare professional before beginning any diet, exercise, or supplement program, especially if you are pregnant, nursing, have a medical condition, or are taking any medications. Discontinue use and consult your healthcare provider if any adverse reactions occur.</p>",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#101123",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        "dropdown_MEWGfc": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "What is the best time of day to take Igniton supplements?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Most people prefer to take<em> </em>IgniCognition in the morning and IgniLongevity in the afternoon, with or without food, depending on your schedule. We do not recommend taking IgniCognition in the afternoon or evening.</p>",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#101123",
            "text_color": "#ffffff"
          }
        }
      },
